# Host build output must never enter the image context: `COPY . .` runs after
# `dotnet restore`, so a host obj/project.assets.json would overwrite the one the
# restore just produced and break RID-specific builds (NETSDK1047).
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Python side-artifacts from src/AI/hiring-agent (built by its own Dockerfile).
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/

**/.DS_Store
**/logs/
**/*.user
